OL,3,GNEWSAPlans for police kennels at former
OL,4,Aanimal shelter
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former cat and dog shelter could be
OL,7,Fknocked down to make way for a
OL,8,Fdedicated police dog kennels.
OL,10,FNorthumbria Police is looking to
OL,11,Fdemolish Newcastle Dog and Cat shelter,
OL,12,Fon Claremont Road in Newcastle, and
OL,13,Freplace it with kennels and a training
OL,14,Ffacility.
OL,16,FIts previous site in Ponteland closed
OL,17,Fin 2016 and since then the force has
OL,18,Fbeen relying on temporary arrangements,
OL,19,Fplanning documents said.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
