OL,3,GNEWSAPlans for police kennels at former
OL,4,Aanimal shelter
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe new facility will include two
OL,7,Fbuildings including kennels,
OL,8,Fadministration and training facilities,
OL,9,Fparking spaces and a dog exercise and
OL,10,Ftraining field.
